!scripts/check_env_parity.py

# Repo-root scratch YAML — k3s helm-values / other one-off overrides
# an operator might drop next to the repo (e.g. `alloy.yaml`,
# `loki.yaml` scratch files during the v1.2 k3s smoke). Deploy-side
# real values files live under deploy/ and are not affected.
/alloy.yaml
/loki.yaml
